WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:10.409
It is one day until my birthday.

2
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.332
The invitation cards have been sent.

3
00:00:13.333 --> 00:00:16.732
Mom will prepare the food.

4
00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:20.415
Hana: Mom, tomorrow is the big day.

5
00:00:20.416 --> 00:00:21.661
Mom: I know.

6
00:00:21.662 --> 00:00:24.250
What would you like for your birthday meal?

7
00:00:24.251 --> 00:00:26.282
Hana: My favorites!

8
00:00:26.283 --> 00:00:31.597
Barbecued chicken, spaghetti, and kimbab, please.

9
00:00:31.598 --> 00:00:33.732
Mom: What about a cake?

10
00:00:33.733 --> 00:00:36.653
Hana: Oh, yeah. A cake too.

11
00:00:36.654 --> 00:00:40.313
Bada: I want a yummy ice cream cake.

12
00:00:40.314 --> 00:00:42.764
Hana: It's not your birthday, Bada.

13
00:00:42.765 --> 00:00:47.117
Hana: Mom, I would like a chocolate cake please.

14
00:00:47.118 --> 00:00:50.593
Mom: Sure. How many do you expect?

15
00:00:50.594 --> 00:00:55.828
Hana: Hmm, about 9 to 11 people.

16
00:00:55.829 --> 00:00:56.971
Mom: I see.

17
00:00:56.972 --> 00:01:02.639
Well, let's go grocery shopping then.

18
00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:05.566
Bada: Are you going to buy the cake now?

19
00:01:05.567 --> 00:01:07.655
Mom: I will do that tomorrow.

20
00:01:07.656 --> 00:01:12.007
Hana: Let's go, Hada!

21
00:01:12.008 --> 00:01:16.096
We put up many pretty balloons in the living room.

22
00:01:16.097 --> 00:01:24.615
That night I dreamed a wonderful dream.
